{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sweet Slaughter",
    "steam_appid": 3303180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/3ab01c3fc7f07d67b9c9cbe452ce657b.avif?t=1753368933\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping <i><strong>action roguelike</strong></i> where you face endless waves of enemies! In Sweet Slaughter, choose a hero with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and battle against ever-increasing hordes of monsters. With each level-up, you can choose from <strong>Modifiers and Augments</strong> to enhance your stats and gain additional <strong>special effects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 15 minutes, a powerful <strong>boss</strong> appears, which you must defeat to successfully complete your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.poster.avif?t=1753368933\" width=800 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.webm?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.mp4?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from various characters, each with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Choices</strong>: After selecting your <strong>Attribute Augments</strong>, you can unlock powerful <strong>Effect Augments</strong> that grant unique advantages in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Can you survive for 15 minutes against the hordes of monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a challenging experience that tests your <strong>skills</strong> and strategic decisions as you fight against cute but deadly monsters!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/3ab01c3fc7f07d67b9c9cbe452ce657b.avif?t=1753368933\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping <i><strong>action roguelike</strong></i> where you face endless waves of enemies! In Sweet Slaughter, choose a hero with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and battle against ever-increasing hordes of monsters. With each level-up, you can choose from <strong>Modifiers and Augments</strong> to enhance your stats and gain additional <strong>special effects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 15 minutes, a powerful <strong>boss</strong> appears, which you must defeat to successfully complete your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.poster.avif?t=1753368933\" width=800 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.webm?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.mp4?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from various characters, each with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Choices</strong>: After selecting your <strong>Attribute Augments</strong>, you can unlock powerful <strong>Effect Augments</strong> that grant unique advantages in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Can you survive for 15 minutes against the hordes of monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a challenging experience that tests your <strong>skills</strong> and strategic decisions as you fight against cute but deadly monsters!</p>",
    "short_description": "Face endless waves of enemies in this action roguelike! Choose a hero, enhance your stats with Modifiers, and unlock powerful Augments. Can you survive for 15 minutes?",
